cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINNs)"
abstract: "Physics-informed neural networks for the 1D heat equation and the 1D viscous Burgers equation, validated against their exact solutions (separation of variables; Cole-Hopf). The Burgers recipe of Raissi, Perdikaris & Karniadakis (2019) is rerun over 20 seeds with the authors' optimizer, in float32 and float64. The final training loss and the PDE residual on a fresh grid are compared as ways to tell good runs from bad ones without the exact solution."
